,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5-dev, commits see below.\n\n### System information\n\n`godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64`\n\n### Issue description\n\nOur test suite that uses several GDScripts now reports memory leaks on shutdown:\n```yaml\nERROR: 7 resources still in use at exit.\n   at: clear (core/io/resource.cpp:629)\nResource still in use: res://ManualFfiTests.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://TestSuite.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://gen/GenFfiTests.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://InheritTests.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://ScriptInstanceTests.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://SpecialTests.gd (GDScript)\nResource still in use: res://TestSuiteSpecial.gd (GDScript)\n```\n\nExample CI run: [Link](https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/actions/runs/14691896007/job/41228359616#step:3:1702)\n\nA bisect showed that the problem started appearing as of the following commit (thanks @yarwin):\n\n* First bad commit: 28089c40c13597bf908802c61352c6fffe0a4465 (PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91006)\n* Last good commit: 500e0d5dc407697217663c134031da00e9dfa625\n\nMaybe a bit of background, our GDScript tests run some manually written assertions, and collect some error stats. They also enable/disable engine printing. I wonder if any of that is related to the changes in the first bad commit. See e.g. [`TestSuite.gd`](https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/blob/master/itest/godot/TestSuite.gd) and [`TestSuiteSpecial.gd`](https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/blob/master/itest/godot/TestSuiteSpecial.gd)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe problem appeared in Release build (export templates in headless mode), I didn't see it in Debug/Editor builds.\n\nI couldn't reproduce it with just a simple GDScript file + Rust GDExtension, so I wonder what's needed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105834/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105834/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}